<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 7,100 MT were primarily the result of purchases by Jamaica (3,400 MT), Panama (2,000 MT), and Haiti (1,500 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 7,700 MT were mainly to Mexico (7,600 MT).</p>
